# FursGo design tokens

When styling UI in this repo, reuse colors, fonts, and weights already used in `assets/css/common.css`, `assets/css/groomer_space_profile.css`, `assets/css/responsive.css`, and nearby existing components. Do not invent new hex values or typography that are outside the current scheme.

## Preferred colors

- Text: `#3B3731`, muted `#9D9B98`
- Groomer accent: `#FBAC83` / `var(--groomer-color)`
- Active / warm highlight: `#FFC97A` / `var(--active-bg)`
- Space / coral tags: `#FFA899` / `var(--space-color)`, `#F3A99F`
- Success / availability green: `#A4C25C`, `#D1E3A6`, `#BACF8E`, `#D8E8B7`
- Surfaces: `#FDFCF8`, `#F7F7F5`, `#FFF`, borders `#D4D4D4` / `#E4E1DB`

## Typography

- Headings: `"Playfair Display"`
- UI / body: `Lato`
- Match existing font-size and font-weight patterns from similar components before introducing new ones

## Rule of thumb

If a color/font/weight is not already present in the design system or the screen being edited, pick the closest existing token instead of creating a new one.
